`parents.push(edge.parent)` — `parents` is mutable array; `groups.get` returns `IdentityVersionID[] | undefined`; after check, mutable. Good.
`ordered` uses `.sort(compareStrings)` on `IdentityVersionID[]`; `compareStrings` accepts strings; branded strings assignable to string. Good.
`request.assessmentIdFor` returns `AssessmentID`; assigning to `unknown` fine.
`validateJsonValue(id)` where `id` is `AssessmentID` (string); returns `Result<JsonValue>`; check.
`candidates.push` object with branded values; `unknown[]` fine.
`registerOrphanAssessments(candidates, request.graph, request.existing)`: candidates `unknown[]`; good.
`admitted.value.slice(request.existing.length)`: `request.existing` is `readonly DeepReadonly<...>[]`; `.length` fine.
`Object.freeze` returns `readonly DeepReadonly<...>[]`; good.

