- `readAssessmentHeader(object)` returns `Result<{ assessmentId, subject, profile, method, assessedBy, assessedAt }>`.
- `readParentIds(object, subject)` returns `Result<IdentityVersionID[]>`.
- `readClaimArrays(object)` returns `Result<{ verified, unverified, evidence }>`.
- `readRelation(object)` returns `Result<LineageRelationType>`.
